      "side": 1,
      "message": "In future, it could be nice to e.g. have rkpd report the provisioning state in dumpsys, or force trigger a re-provisioning. For now, we can get the basics directly from system_server with the one caveat of needing sepolicy to let system_server call the HALs.\n\nI did notice some mention of `handleShellCommand()` being a stable interface which got me wondering whether the module can include the whole service implementation in some cases but I haven\u0027t looked any further.",
