      "message": "Ah, I didn\u0027t think about future commands like triggering provisioning manually. That would indeed be neat to have.\n\nI did a little digging, and it\u0027s not clear to me there\u0027s a stable API we can rely on here to pass shell commands into RKPD. Seems like we\u0027d need to make it a new interface.\n\nThe best info on the topic I could find is the thread here: https://groups.google.com/a/google.com/g/android-binder/c/OVnWKJ6wXgk/m/qrgLayO-FAAJ\n\nMy current thinking is that we should ship this as-is, then add the shell command redirect in V.",
